findings.recommendation:
Add one assertion to the existing 'rejects empty and non-numeric input' test for validateDiscountFields, mirroring the pattern already used for min_qty/percent:
```js
for (const bad of ["", "   ", "abc", null, undefined, NaN]) {
  expect(validateDiscountFields({ ...validDiscount, min_qty: bad }).valid).toBe(false);
  expect(validateDiscountFields({ ...validDiscount, max_qty: bad }).valid).toBe(false);
  expect(validateDiscountFields({ ...validDiscount, percent: bad }).valid).toBe(false);
}
```
This is not required by the task's 9 TDD anchors or AC (which only require 'max_qty < min_qty' coverage, already present) — flagging for completeness per test-master's litmus methodology, not as a blocker.
